The usual cause of starvation is hanging around on the same level too long.
Last time I looked in the code of Rogue/Hack/Nethack, the games guaranteed
that you would find food at least once per several levels.  Until you find
a food shop, eat something filling (Centuars are nice), or accumulate five
or so food rations ahead, "rush in where angels fear to tread"; make haste
to that next food ration down the way.

